{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WARLANCER - Armored Survivor is an entry in the top down survivor shooter genre that seeks to blend elements of bullet heaven and hell games with a weapon system that focuses on synergy between different weapon types. Utilise weapon connections that allow other weapons to be fired on hit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is currently in demo phase and will develop taking player feedback into account. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202090/extras/trailer3.gif?t=1749842366\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Accessible Demo Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One of three levels with different map objectives </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One of three selectable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Six of twelve weapons</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3202090?t=1749842366","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3202090?t=1749842366","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202090/c01a5b702d9646455d753775d83c892124a2f5f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749842366","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3202090/c01a5b702d9646455d753775d83c892124a2f5f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749842366","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WARLANCER - Armored Survivor is an entry in the top down survivor shooter genre that seeks to blend elements of bullet heaven and hell games with a weapon system that focuses on synergy between different weapon types. Utilise weapo